- **Long function syndrome** — every file has exactly 1 function doing everything
- **Mixed concerns** — business logic + I/O + formatting all inline
- **Repeated boilerplate** — `most_common()` iteration (3×), error-collection pattern (5 fields × 2 files), file-writing boilerplate (3× in `user_importer`)
